    "changes": [
      "Reconstructed full RCA scene graph transforms, centimetre-to-metre scale, instance mirrors and all four wheels/doors.",
      "Centered X by -151.7 source centimetres; preserved Y-up and front along negative X.",
      "Retained source topology, split normals, UV coordinates and baked vertex color AO; no geometry decimation.",
      "Adjusted paint to neutral metallic silver, glass/transparency, chrome/rubber/interior materials and lamp emission.",
      "Embedded source tire normal map at 1024px; no external network asset required at runtime.",
      "Applied Draco compression with 16-bit position, 12-bit normal, 14-bit UV and 10-bit color quantization; compression is an adaptation, not a technical measurement.",
      "Tagged every mesh node with partId, sourceFile, sourceMesh and sourceRcaId.",
      "Portable GLB material correction: explicitly stored PBR baseColorFactor and front/rear emissiveFactor values after Blender vertex-AO material export, preserving physical roughness, metalness, alpha and clearcoat."
    ],
